{"word":"goldbrick","ipa":"'gәuldbrik","persianMeaning":"سربازی که وظایفش را بی‌دقتی انجام می‌دهد، شخص بیکار و بی‌ارزش، فریب دادن و محروم کردن، از انجام وظایف اختصاص‌یافته‌ی خود اجتناب کردن","englishDefinition":"n. a soldier who performs his duties without proper care or effort\\nn. an idle worthless person\\nn. a brick-shaped block that looks like gold but is not","partOfSpeech":"noun","example":"The sergeant called out the goldbrick for neglecting his guard duties again.","examplePersian":"آن سرباز یک goldbrick بود و هرگز دستورات را درست اجرا نمی‌کرد.","cefrLevel":"C2","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"wordFamily":[],"commonMistakes":"","ieltsRelevance":"Medium","toeflRelevance":"Medium","greRelevance":"High","tags":["GRE","offline","ECDICT","gre","needs-collocation"],"source":"ECDICT + Openjam + EnglishToPersianDictionaries","sourceLicense":"ECDICT MIT; Openjam MIT; EnglishToPersianDictionaries Apache-2.0","frequencyRank":101511,"examPriority":3}
